---
// src/components/CtaStrip.astro
---

<section class="cta-strip border-t-hairline border-b-hairline">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <div class="cta-text-group">
      <h2 class="cta-title" data-i18n="cta_title">Toma el control de tu terminal hoy mismo.</h2>
      <p class="cta-desc" data-i18n="cta_desc">Instalación no intrusiva. Sin cuentas de usuario. Desinstalación limpia en un solo comando.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <button type="button" class="cta-copy-action font-mono" id="btn-cta-copy" aria-label="Copiar comando de instalación">
        <span class="cta-prompt">$</span> curl -fsSL ... | bash
        <span class="cta-copy-badge" id="cta-copy-badge" data-i18n="cta_badge">Copiar</span>
      </button>
      <a href="https://github.com/dannielnavas/nacel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-gh-link font-mono">
        GitHub Repo →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-strip {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .cta-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-desc {
    color: var(--text-steel);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-copy-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    background: #0f1017;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline-bright);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--text-platinum);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-copy-action:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .cta-prompt {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .cta-copy-badge {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--text-pure);
  }

  .cta-gh-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-gh-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-pure);
    border-color: var(--hairline-bright);
  }
</style>
